# Demo reset

Apply this only when someone `@`-mentions `demo-reset`.

Between workshop groups, run `./scripts/reset-demo-state.sh`. That restores `SUGGESTED_CREDIT_API_VERSION` to v1 and removes an invoice email form if a practice session added one.

Do not run the script unless the user asks. Do not edit `TestSuggestedCreditUsesV2Cap`.
